      "date": "2026-05-31T06:19:23.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹45.16 (vs ₹21.38 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹45.16 (up from ₹21.38 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹1.71b (up 22% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹130.1m (up 111% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 7.6% (up from 4.4% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 21% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 20% per year.",
