      "title": "Bhagwati Autocast Limited Recommends Final Dividend for the Year Ended 31 March, 2026",
      "body": "The board of directors of Bhagwati Autocast Limited at its meeting held on 29 May, 2026, The Board of Directors has recommended final dividend of INR 3.50 (i.e. 35%) per fully paid up equity share of face value of INR 10 each for the year ended 31 March, 2026. The dividend, if approved by the members at upcoming Annual General Meeting, will be dispatched /remitted within 30 days from the date of declaration.",
