      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹12.29 (vs ₹4.91 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹12.29 (up from ₹4.91 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹429.3m (up 36% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹35.4m (up 150% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 8.2% (up from 4.5% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 16% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 35% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
